  "notes": "Verb type: {サ変動詞|さへんどうし} (suru-verb variant)\nTransitivity: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive) - takes に\n\nUSAGE:\n- Common in legal documents, contracts, and regulations\n- Often translated as \"mutatis mutandis\" in legal contexts\n- Also written as {準|じゅん}じる\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～に{準|じゅん}ずる: to follow, conform to\n- ～に{準|じゅん}じた{扱|あつか}い: treatment equivalent to\n- {準|じゅん}じて{適用|てきよう}する: to apply correspondingly",
